+### blob/data 的导航与 BFCache
+
+```bash
+npm run smoke:opaque-frames
+npm run smoke:opaque-frames -- --extension=/path/to/ext --evidence=/tmp/opaque.json
+npm run smoke:opaque-recovery -- --evidence=/tmp/opaque-recovery.json
